    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "74b149bab7947a88909d17bd9ccab02e18139af6ead0a157842a3265e6424c69",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good morning, Dr. Harley.",
    "zh": "早上好，哈利博士。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Good morning"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "ba728550e2dece90f52cc6cdee3657811f77b4dc6b06f2ce377ffb7853d5f44e",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thank you very much for coming on our radio talk.",
    "zh": "非常感谢您来到我们的广播访谈节目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "radio talk"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "9500abd256baed6be7a9bb5a9735bf7af82426098d9797f6abbb77532efb24e5",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We know that you are an applied linguist specializing in second language acquisition.",
    "zh": "我们知道，您是一位专门研究第二语言习得的应用语言学家。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "applied linguist"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "554cef1f186c5465cfc7a0575e4bb538f803abe606fbde92a58a75ea3adc9749",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Right.",
    "zh": "是的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Right"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "e9579b121556a13f63fbe81f1183835893eb8103cb4d8a998182b2b7f58188bb",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, today, urmm... we’ll look at this issue.",
    "zh": "那么，今天，嗯……我们就来探讨这个问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "issue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "4cf0e6283045cced316aac78f7748b65964b0e1589f283e122b618366edc6014",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, first, Dr. Harley, could you please tell us what is second language acquisition?",
    "zh": "首先，哈利博士，能否请您告诉我们，什么是第二语言习得？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "second language acquisition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "b4e5ba227c0ac917d96bd5a31a53da2da278248fe59b701c15fc7efd1adcde86",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, second language acquisition is “happens when a child or adult has already become competent at a language, and then, urmm... they attempt to learn another.”",
    "zh": "嗯，第二语言习得是指这样的情况：儿童或成年人已经掌握了一种语言，然后，嗯……再尝试学习另一种语言。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "competent at"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "d4d7af27eabe884ff0e01f945202cdca7a025480b915d2d9cef212ed84152eb5",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK, most people think, including me, it is difficult to learn another language.",
    "zh": "好的。大多数人，包括我自己，都觉得学习另一种语言很难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "including"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "87c46f588c3745a95fbff43d52f7432fd1c05a9c92b6a2d136b5d2dff264c309",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What are the reasons? Why is it so?",
    "zh": "原因有哪些？为什么会这样？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "reason"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "d83894e5e347d66979dbda5b17a63d97aacac85e388a6d8b203e54779515e285",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, there are a number of reasons for this.",
    "zh": "嗯，这有好几个原因。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "a number of"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "6450ae9850ec4f3a0df92102079abdbb0827284b34b60ff46a82484165115076",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Urmm... first, there have been research studies.",
    "zh": "嗯……首先，已经有一些相关研究。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "research study"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "debf5a0e3b6a3924af525940af27c19af65f580eab5f8c68d52e0147a2c4d9b6",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They have shown that some aspects of language learning, especially syntax, are more difficult beyond a certain age, say after around 12 years of age.",
    "zh": "研究表明，语言学习的某些方面，尤其是句法，在超过一定年龄后，例如大约十二岁以后，会变得更难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "syntax"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "7d49ed6ba4d62045c4e0747c9125dc6e2e4f0773431e5092859db6ccb7fda173",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, age plays an important role in language learning?",
    "zh": "所以，年龄在语言学习中起着重要作用，是吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "play an important role"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "1c0e8e41a54fd25a027a75ce6e5e5d856d05245a8844bc2042e7abdb200ecfbb",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes. But that’s not the only reason.",
    "zh": "是的。但这并不是唯一的原因。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "reason"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "7efa23ba7af1f6b1e127cf357544bfe6959e5f51dbd7170182f0dc591b1538ef",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Oh, is that so?",
    "zh": "哦，是这样吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "is that so"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "c02b046f8c0923b80530c0cd3ddc0bd5fe38fbd8fb0dd2c21c57365c853dfa44",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes. For example, umm, time and interest.",
    "zh": "是的。例如，嗯，时间和兴趣。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "cdf3ff7326544cf785fb30b70ea99af365f72cc4b63ec28a9792d4cb18f76750",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Old children and adults often have less time and motivation to learn a second language.",
    "zh": "年龄较大的孩子和成年人，往往没有那么多时间和动力去学习第二语言。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "motivation"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "5e8e9e1de24aa0272c707d87374f0b9b06946019e23f1e93978058d5ecb98ec4",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Another is related to the similarities and differences between one’s mother tongue and a second language.",
    "zh": "另一个原因与母语和第二语言之间的相似性及差异有关。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mother tongue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "7cfd61b2d2e23ea1b5f2c2ef3168808500ba052eb1498a76a599e117dfda0ede",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We find that learners will experience difficulty when their mother tongue and the second language they are learning differ.",
    "zh": "我们发现，当母语与正在学习的第二语言存在差异时，学习者就会遇到困难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "differ"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "bc3e31d07fdb0dcad01a79b93017febd1ea6cd2f03fae8b438958a507749fa14",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In general, the more idiosyncratic a feature is in a particular language, relative to other languages, the more difficult it will be to acquire.",
    "zh": "一般来说，相比其他语言，某种语言的一个特征越独特，习得这个特征就越困难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "idiosyncratic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "7470661590f9b40beb21c242eb676ff518284bde0d4aebbd1ed27b468c999b5e",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Perhaps this is the key issue.",
    "zh": "也许这正是关键所在。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "key issue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "b8d3c9e09fbf26a08bb2fc2f756e9938b6cfcfc01fdcc2108422fd3cdfe0af54",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Differences between languages cause language learning problems.",
    "zh": "语言之间的差异会导致语言学习困难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "cause"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "36b32689f89bbbc99ffbfeab4166470d1496dfb3d67bb04cff38f3c3fb001482",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, this may be one of the issues here, but this cannot be the whole story, as not all differences between languages cause difficulty.",
    "zh": "嗯，这也许是其中的一个问题，但事情并不完全如此，因为并非语言之间的所有差异都会造成困难。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "the whole story"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "05d14bf93bbaa157c9d72e7e92cec6f3a7e47f62284ccaa104066499d2afd1a4",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Let me give you an example.",
    "zh": "让我举个例子。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "give an example"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "b1d45b9d2c85617fe8f623cc3bb27895139d344fbf2bc78b5c20f8cf97c69e85",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK.",
    "zh": "好的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "OK"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "50aa8fb54c73bb82872d3860474ffa7ab0a893becc252cfe70c3f4e64055ad40",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Research has found that many errors by Czech speakers learning English were made on syntactic constructions in which the two languages do not differ.",
    "zh": "研究发现，母语为捷克语的人学习英语时，许多错误恰恰出现在两种语言没有差异的句法结构上。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "syntactic construction"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "3452af42b7085beea867cd47275bd1c40e8d766d1eab5b70ecc4494af159a4be",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Oh, really? The picture is more complicated than we’ve imagined.",
    "zh": "哦，真的吗？情况比我们想象的还要复杂。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "complicated"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "99585234952e53a5857426c087b55db8cca9ab9461a372b13ac5cda819ef0200",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Definitely yes.",
    "zh": "确实如此。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Definitely"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "999f5127312e61de4496e9adbe9b733c84bec49273b428bede23dc6157a8c403",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Each language learning situation is different.",
    "zh": "每一种语言学习情境都不同。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "situation"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "71c0b1f7e09b88e282ecc531ec42e7cae179f50015f8b3235a67e0822e820b65",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So reasons vary a lot from case to case.",
    "zh": "所以，原因会因具体情况而大不相同。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "from case to case"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "4910943855e3a8f37193093c35d60f9d1b33d8c84de7ea14afd8cb400367ef43",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, Dr. Harley. Since learning a second language is a difficult process, you know, ",
    "zh": "那么，哈利博士，既然学习第二语言是一个艰难的过程，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "process"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "c789132cca0bf1263833f37403ae57e9e0a421ad2ad727e4018603a16c04d491",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "in one way or another, are there any methods, so far, effective methods to teach a second language?",
    "zh": "或多或少都会遇到困难，那么到目前为止，有没有什么方法，有效的方法，来教授第二语言？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "in one way or another"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "85a39b95b3932be4c98bfc628078488f8c4ec1f27df52a13e7f56e1a0d32cb8e",
    "k": 42,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "There again. No method is absolutely effective in all situations.",
    "zh": "这里也是一样。没有一种方法在所有情境下都绝对有效。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "absolutely"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "64414f908bb1aa719e214cfa073fcd432cd41ca405a635e1ea376b791cf46f31",
    "k": 43,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Some may prove effective, others may not.",
    "zh": "有些方法可能有效，有些则可能无效。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "prove effective"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen046.png",
    "sha256": "a8722e4848a0c11dc2f64e0d9a876fbfb5750a84447a8316cd9878858dd6051a",
    "k": 44,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I mean, all depending on specific conditions.",
    "zh": "我的意思是，一切都取决于具体条件。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "specific conditions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen047.png",
    "sha256": "664bff2d355198b0136a3e084f88a7a4a472551e01cf38a1537bb66826b0b068",
    "k": 45,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But generally speaking, there are a number of methods that have been used to teach a second language.",
    "zh": "不过，一般来说，已经有若干种方法被用于第二语言教学。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "generally speaking"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen048.png",
    "sha256": "292f71460583b09c99bd474bc20c8d224b7e4e0eaebf5fc96b71f55715119819",
    "k": 46,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Could you mention a few?",
    "zh": "您能举出几种吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mention"
    ]
  },
  {
